<view class="wood-page nuts-page">
  <view class="wood-header nuts-header">
    <view class="nuts-stat">
      <text class="head-label">关卡</text>
      <text class="head-value head-gold">{{level}}<text class="nuts-total"> / {{levelCount}}</text></text>
    </view>
    <view class="nuts-stat">
      <text class="head-label">步数 · 基准{{par}}</text>
      <text class="head-value">{{steps}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="nuts-stat">
      <text class="head-label">归位</text>
      <text class="head-value">{{completed}}<text class="nuts-total"> / {{colors}}</text></text>
    </view>
    <view class="wood-knob nuts-level-btn" bindtap="onShowLevels">选关</view>
  </view>

  <view class="nuts-caption">
    <view class="nuts-chapter-tag">
      <text class="wood-label">{{levelName}}</text>
      <view class="nuts-live-stars">
        <text class="nuts-star {{stars >= 1 ? 'nuts-star-on' : ''}}">★</text>
        <text class="nuts-star {{stars >= 2 ? 'nuts-star-on' : ''}}">★</text>
        <text class="nuts-star {{stars >= 3 ? 'nuts-star-on' : ''}}">★</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="nuts-caption-actions">
      <view class="nuts-pill" bindtap="onMute">
        <text class="nuts-pill-icon">{{muted ? '✕' : '♪'}}</text>
        <text>{{muted ? '静音' : '音效'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="nuts-pill nuts-pill-help" bindtap="onHelp">
        <text class="nuts-pill-icon">?</text>
        <text>玩法</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <canvas
    id="nut-canvas"
    type="2d"
    class="nuts-canvas"
    bindtouchstart="onCanvasTouchStart"
    bindtouchmove="onCanvasTouchMove"
    bindtouchend="onCanvasTouchEnd"
    bindtouchcancel="onCanvasTouchCancel"
  ></canvas>

  <view class="nuts-tip-wrap">
    <view class="nuts-tip">
      <view wx:if="{{selectedColorIndex > 0}}" class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-{{selectedColorIndex}}">{{selectedColorIndex}}</view>
      <text class="nuts-tip-text">{{ready ? tip : '木作台准备中…'}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="wood-console nuts-console">
    <view class="nuts-keys">
      <view class="wood-key nuts-key {{canUndo ? '' : 'nuts-disabled'}}" bindtap="onUndo">
        <text class="nuts-key-icon">↶</text>
        <text>撤销</text>
      </view>
      <view class="wood-key nuts-key {{hintBusy ? 'nuts-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onHint">
        <text class="nuts-key-icon">◇</text>
        <text>{{hintBusy ? '寻找中' : '提示'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="wood-key nuts-key" bindtap="onRestart">
        <text class="nuts-key-icon">↻</text>
        <text>重开</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="nuts-footnote">同色归一 · 绿圈指引落点 · 满柱自动封帽</text>
  </view>

  <view class="overlay" wx:if="{{gameState === 'win'}}" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="plaque nuts-plaque">
      <view class="nail nail-tl"></view><view class="nail nail-tr"></view><view class="nail nail-bl"></view><view class="nail nail-br"></view>
      <view class="plaque-head">
        <text class="plaque-title">{{level === levelCount ? '大师收工' : '归色完成'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="plaque-body">
        <view class="nuts-win-stars">
          <text class="nuts-win-star {{stars >= 1 ? 'nuts-win-star-on' : ''}}">★</text>
          <text class="nuts-win-star {{stars >= 2 ? 'nuts-win-star-on' : ''}}">★</text>
          <text class="nuts-win-star {{stars >= 3 ? 'nuts-win-star-on' : ''}}">★</text>
        </view>
        <view class="nuts-win-badges">
          <text class="score-label">{{starTitle}}</text>
          <view class="newbest-badge" wx:if="{{isNewBest}}">
            <text class="newbest-text">新纪录</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="score-num">{{steps}}<text class="nuts-score-unit"> 步</text></text>
        <text class="plaque-text">第 {{level}} 关 · {{levelName}}</text>
        <view class="stat-grid nuts-stat-grid">
          <view class="stat-cell">
            <text class="cell-label">本局步数</text>
            <text class="cell-value">{{steps}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="stat-cell">
            <text class="cell-label">匠心基准</text>
            <text class="cell-value">{{par}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="stat-cell">
            <text class="cell-label">个人最佳</text>
            <text class="cell-value">{{best}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="btn-col">
          <view class="wbtn wbtn-primary" bindtap="onNext">{{level === levelCount ? '回顾关卡' : '下一关 ›'}}</view>
          <view class="wbtn" bindtap="onRestart">再整理一次</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="overlay" wx:if="{{showLevels}}" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="plaque nuts-plaque">
      <view class="nail nail-tl"></view><view class="nail nail-tr"></view><view class="nail nail-bl"></view><view class="nail nail-br"></view>
      <view class="plaque-head"><text class="plaque-title">木作关卡</text></view>
      <view class="plaque-body nuts-level-body">
        <view class="nuts-summary-bar">
          <text class="nuts-summary-item">已通 {{clearedCount}} / {{levelCount}} 关</text>
          <text class="nuts-summary-sep">·</text>
          <text class="nuts-summary-item nuts-summary-gold">匠心 ★ {{totalStars}} / {{maxStars}}</text>
        </view>
        <scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="nuts-level-scroll">
          <view class="nuts-level-grid">
            <view
              wx:for="{{levelList}}"
              wx:key="index"
              class="nuts-level {{item.locked ? 'nuts-locked' : ''}} {{item.current ? 'nuts-current' : ''}}"
              data-index="{{item.index}}"
              bindtap="onPickLevel"
            >
              <text class="nuts-level-number">{{item.locked ? '🔒' : item.label}}</text>
              <text wx:if="{{!item.locked && item.stars > 0}}" class="nuts-level-stars">{{item.stars === 3 ? '★★★' : (item.stars === 2 ? '★★☆' : '★☆☆')}}</text>
              <text class="nuts-level-best">{{item.locked ? '未解锁' : (item.best ? item.best + '步' : '待完成')}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </scroll-view>
        <view class="btn-col"><view class="wbtn" bindtap="onCloseLevels">继续整理</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="overlay" wx:if="{{showHelp}}" catchtouchmove="noop">
    <view class="plaque nuts-plaque">
      <view class="nail nail-tl"></view><view class="nail nail-tr"></view><view class="nail nail-bl"></view><view class="nail nail-br"></view>
      <view class="plaque-head"><text class="plaque-title">木螺母归色</text></view>
      <view class="plaque-body">
        <view class="nuts-palette-row">
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-1">1</view>
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-2">2</view>
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-3">3</view>
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-4">4</view>
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-5">5</view>
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-6">6</view>
          <view class="nuts-swatch nuts-swatch-7">7</view>
        </view>
        <view class="nuts-instructions">
          <text>① 轻点一根木柱，旋出并抬起最顶端的螺母。</text>
          <text>② 柱底亮起绿圈即为可放位置（空柱或顶端同色柱）。</text>
          <text>③ 当前关每根柱子可容纳 {{capacity}} 枚，集满同色即加盖铜帽。</text>
          <text>④ 步数越接近「匠心基准」，通关获得的星级越高。</text>
        </view>
        <text class="plaque-hint">螺母正面烙有 1–7 编号辅助辨色。点「提示」后可直接点终点柱一步归置。</text>
        <view class="btn-col btn-col-gap"><view class="wbtn wbtn-primary" bindtap="onCloseHelp">开始整理</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
